# Allow only inputs copied by Dockerfile. In particular, no designer world,
# checkout metadata, local secrets, caches, crash dumps or scratch directories
# are sent to the builder, even when building from a dirty checkout.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!mix.exs
!mix.lock
!config/
!config/config.exs
!config/prod.exs
!config/runtime.exs
!lib/
!lib/**
!assets/
!assets/**
!priv/
!priv/static/
!priv/static/**
!priv/repo/
!priv/repo/**
priv/worlds
priv/worlds/**
config/dev.exs
config/test.exs
**/node_modules
**/.env*
**/.venv
**/deps
**/_build
**/tmp
**/erl_crash.dump
priv/static/assets/js
priv/static/assets/css/maplibre-gl.css
priv/static/assets/fonts
